capacity response → future profitability
capacity overshoot → future residual returns
emission/depth → future residual returns
miner flow/depth → future residual returns
L2 absorption → future short-horizon returns
```

For each test, run multiple lags and walk-forward validation.

6. **Build event studies.** Before complicated ML, automatically identify:

